  "item_short_desc": "<p>As a part of Rothco&rsquo;s Frontline Series, the Guardian AR 670-1 Coyote Brown Tactical Boot is engineered to keep you on your feet and moving while offering unbeatable comfort and durability on the field. The 8 inch height provides additional ankle support and protection during patrols and tactical operations. Just like our other Frontline boots, The Guardian is TAA compliant. Developed with Rothco&rsquo;s Lock System, The Guardian features a waterproof design that provides long-lasting comfort and enhanced traction.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133418",
  "description": "<p>As a part of Rothco&rsquo;s Frontline Series, the Guardian AR 670-1 Coyote Brown Tactical Boot is engineered to keep you on your feet and moving while offering unbeatable comfort and durability on the field. The 8 inch height provides additional ankle support and protection during patrols and tactical operations. Just like our other Frontline boots, The Guardian is TAA compliant. Developed with Rothco&rsquo;s Lock System, The Guardian features a waterproof design that provides long-lasting comfort and enhanced traction. H2O Lock Weather Protection System: Featuring a waterproof full grain leather and polyester upper, these brown tactical boots ensure your feet stay dry, no matter the environment. The combat boot utilizes a waterproof internal lining for added protection, with a moisture wicking mesh liner underneath for breathability while keeping water out. The gusseted tongue helps shield your foot from dirt and debris. Comfort Lock Fatigue Defense System: The molded EVA footbed and EVA midsole help absorb shock, cushioning your feet from impact while providing all-day comfort. These breathable tactical boots feature a lightweight flexible bonded construction and a nylon shank for added support and stability. Ground Lock Terrain Endurance System: These tactical work boots come equipped with a high grip lug rubber outsole that is non-slip and oil-resistant, allowing you to maintain your footing with enhanced grip and traction. The non-marking outsole prevents leaving scuff marks on flooring. Ready at a Moment&rsquo;s Notice: From emergency situations to scheduled patrols, these lightweight tactical boots easily rise above the challenge. These ruggedly durable duty boots are great for first responders, EMTs, security guards, public safety, active-duty personnel, tactical enthusiasts, and more. On The Frontlines: Utilizing the Lock System, each boot within Rothco&rsquo;s Frontline Footwear Series is designed to tackle any job, all day, every day. From field operations to public safety, The Guardian is always ready to protect and serve.</p>",
